title: SAP MaxDB: SQL command performance
agents: linux, windows
catalog: app/maxdb
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Shows SQL statement counters as per-second rates. The current agent output contains only a sampled command, so values are not database-wide.
 Requires the MaxDB agent plugin with the maxdb_performance module enabled.
 Thresholds can be configured using the MaxDB extended monitoring ruleset.
item:
 Database name
discovery:
 One service is discovered for each database with the corresponding agent section.
